{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\": \"submission-loop-note2.json\", \"summary\": \"Turn 98 made a second attempt to exercise the replica's own event loop; it produced two facts and no clean measurement, and both are recorded rather than dressed up.\\n\\nWhat the attempt showed. With a single replica the loop still spends about ten seconds before serving anything — the peer-measurement phase performs twenty rounds with a half-second sleep each, and the panic trace landed only after that interval in both attempts. In this execution environment the listen attempt fails, and because the harness used a non-verbose logger the logger's Fatal is silent, so the failure surfaced later as a nil-listener panic in the goroutine that waits for client connections rather than as the clean exit the production launcher's verbose logger produces.\\n\\nWhat that means for the findings. A clean startup-phase measurement would need an environment that permits binding a local port, or a package-level injection point the implementation does not have; the ten-second phase itself is now confirmed by the timing of two failures rather than by an assumption. The reader-side and crash process-death steps remain inferences from the code (no recover around handlers, fatal only when verbose), exactly as their reviews recorded, and the silent-Fatal behaviour is a configuration-dependent property rather than something this environment can turn into a reviewed result.\\n\\nState. Audit spec version 21; the twelve claim families, the map at version 20, the two capacity-limited items (a review for the executed end-to-end client-reply artifact, unit-plus-review capacity for the reader observation), the two paused candidates, the configuration premises and the attribution issue on the superseded C1 artifact are unchanged. The run's window is nearly closed, and the record now distinguishes what was observed, what was inferred, and what the execution environment prevented from being measured — with no requirement, premise or earlier observation weakened.\"}"}}
